    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The verb «ter» and age",
     "texto": [
      "«To have» is **ter**: tenho, tens, tem, temos, têm.",
      "Age is expressed with «ter», unlike in English: **Quantos anos tens?** (how old are you?) – **Tenho vinte anos** (I am twenty).",
      "Notice **tem** (he has) and **têm** (they have): they are told apart by the accent mark."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
